  - Bring me the three sacred items, and I shall grant you magic.
  injectMessages:
  - Ah, you have gathered them all!
  - Now, feel the power of magic!
  afterUnlockMessages:
  - The magic is now within you.
  - Use it wisely, hero...
  - Farewell...
