      value: 11
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hi Explorer,come back here for a quick refresher on the controls!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[1]'
      value: Press E to interact with signs and objects.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[2]'
      value: Leftt-click mouse to break objects.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[3]'
      value: Press B to access your backpack with items you collect.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[4]'
      value: To win the game, you will have to explore the main area here and three
        other regions connected to this area.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[5]'
      value: 'On the left you will find West Coast Canada. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[6]'
      value: On the right you will find the Prairie Provinces.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[7]'
      value: On the right you will also find the French speaking Quebec area.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[8]'
      value: Win at least two keys or crystal ball from the minigame in the regions
        to start boss fight.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[9]'
      value: Beat the boss and win the game!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6610298952553556158, guid: 6f33585c79d1b3c41b5ae35e609bb957, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogs.Array.data[10]'
      value: Let's go!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
